[{"index": 0, "text": "Hello and welcome to Real Easy English,", "start": 0.03, "end": 3.671}, {"index": 1, "text": "the podcast where we have real conversations", "start": 3.651, "end": 6.992}, {"index": 2, "text": "in easy English", "start": 6.652, "end": 8.273}, {"index": 3, "text": "to help you learn.", "start": 8.053, "end": 9.293}, {"index": 4, "text": "I'm Beth.", "start": 9.193, "end": 10.113}, {"index": 5, "text": "And I'm Neil.", "start": 9.953, "end": 11.194}, {"index": 6, "text": "You can watch this podcast and test yourself with a worksheet,", "start": 11.254, "end": 15.395}, {"index": 7, "text": "which you can get free on our website", "start": 14.995, "end": 17.516}, {"index": 8, "text": "at bbclearningenglish.com.", "start": 17.136, "end": 19.776}, {"index": 9, "text": "So, Neil, how are you today?", "start": 24.638, "end": 27.699}, {"index": 10, "text": "I’m very well actually.", "start": 27.919, "end": 29.3}, {"index": 11, "text": "How are you feeling about our recording today?", "start": 28.9, "end": 32.081}, {"index": 12, "text": "Feeling confident ?", "start": 31.681, "end": 33.481}, {"index": 13, "text": "I’m feeling confident .", "start": 33.081, "end": 34.942}, {"index": 14, "text": "Are you feeling nervous?", "start": 34.542, "end": 36.202}, {"index": 15, "text": "Not at all, no.", "start": 36.102, "end": 37.282}, {"index": 16, "text": "I'm feeling confident .", "start": 36.902, "end": 38.783}, {"index": 17, "text": "Well, today we're talking all about confidence.", "start": 38.383, "end": 42.324}, {"index": 18, "text": "So, listeners might be familiar", "start": 42.304, "end": 44.705}, {"index": 19, "text": "with the adjective confident ,", "start": 44.365, "end": 46.986}, {"index": 20, "text": "which means being certain about something.", "start": 46.586, "end": 49.326}, {"index": 21, "text": "Feeling good about yourself.", "start": 48.926, "end": 50.647}, {"index": 22, "text": "But confidence is the noun,", "start": 51.427, "end": 53.788}, {"index": 23, "text": "and it's that feeling of being certain,", "start": 53.948, "end": 57.589}, {"index": 24, "text": "maybe about your own abilities or about a situation.", "start": 57.21, "end": 61.231}, {"index": 25, "text": "OK, that's a good description, Beth.", "start": 61.311, "end": 64.672}, {"index": 26, "text": "Would you say you are a confident person?", "start": 64.592, "end": 67.073}, {"index": 27, "text": "I think it really depends", "start": 66.673, "end": 70.074}, {"index": 28, "text": "on the situation.", "start": 69.754, "end": 71.194}, {"index": 29, "text": "So if I am speaking with you like this,", "start": 72.615, "end": 77.976}, {"index": 30, "text": "I'm very confiden t, I know you.", "start": 77.796, "end": 80.477}, {"index": 31, "text": "But if I'm around people that I don't know as much,", "start": 80.757, "end": 84.298}, {"index": 32, "text": "then I usually feel a bit more shy .", "start": 84.419, "end": 88.28}, {"index": 33, "text": "Yeah.", "start": 87.88, "end": 88.6}, {"index": 34, "text": "What about you?", "start": 88.38, "end": 89.34}, {"index": 35, "text": "Are you generally confident ?", "start": 88.94, "end": 91.296}, {"index": 36, "text": "I think like you, if I think I know", "start": 91.296, "end": 95.082}, {"index": 37, "text": "what I'm doing,", "start": 94.682, "end": 95.982}, {"index": 38, "text": "then I'm confident .", "start": 95.982, "end": 98.023}, {"index": 39, "text": "But if I'm doing something,", "start": 97.623, "end": 100.004}, {"index": 40, "text": "especially with people", "start": 99.604, "end": 101.524}, {"index": 41, "text": "who maybe know more about that thing than I do,", "start": 101.444, "end": 105.806}, {"index": 42, "text": "then that can be nerve-racking ,", "start": 106.106, "end": 109.807}, {"index": 43, "text": "make you feel nervous, and then", "start": 109.407, "end": 112.108}, {"index": 44, "text": "not be confident .", "start": 112.128, "end": 114.308}, {"index": 45, "text": "Yeah, definitely.", "start": 113.908, "end": 115.149}, {"index": 46, "text": "I remember like being in a class,", "start": 114.749, "end": 119.11}, {"index": 47, "text": "in a classroom and if I feel like", "start": 119.05, "end": 122.951}, {"index": 48, "text": "this topic is just,", "start": 122.551, "end": 124.412}, {"index": 49, "text": "I don't know, then I would not feel confident at all.", "start": 124.012, "end": 128.473}, {"index": 50, "text": "I'd definitely feel nervous.", "start": 128.233, "end": 129.833}, {"index": 51, "text": "What other types of situations would make you feel shy or nervous?", "start": 129.674, "end": 134.055}, {"index": 52, "text": "I think apart from meeting", "start": 133.655, "end": 137.616}, {"index": 53, "text": "new people,", "start": 137.376, "end": 138.476}, {"index": 54, "text": "I always feel a bit nervous with that,", "start": 138.076, "end": 140.837}, {"index": 55, "text": "I’m generally quite confident .", "start": 140.897, "end": 143.658}, {"index": 56, "text": "So, if it comes to something", "start": 143.258, "end": 146.059}, {"index": 57, "text": "like public speaking", "start": 145.719, "end": 147.759}, {"index": 58, "text": "where I have to talk in front of a lot of people,", "start": 147.86, "end": 150.78}, {"index": 59, "text": "if there are people I don't know,", "start": 151.461, "end": 153.541}, {"index": 60, "text": "I don't really have a problem.", "start": 153.141, "end": 156.923}, {"index": 61, "text": "I'm quite confident .", "start": 156.643, "end": 158.663}, {"index": 62, "text": "But if I had to speak to a room of people", "start": 158.263, "end": 161.804}, {"index": 63, "text": "and I know the people,", "start": 161.424, "end": 163.224}, {"index": 64, "text": "that would make me more nervous.", "start": 163.645, "end": 165.625}, {"index": 65, "text": "I don't know if that's weird.", "start": 165.225, "end": 167.786}, {"index": 66, "text": "Maybe.", "start": 168.526, "end": 169.206}, {"index": 67, "text": "I think I'm probably the opposite.", "start": 168.806, "end": 170.927}, {"index": 68, "text": "Really?", "start": 170.987, "end": 171.787}, {"index": 69, "text": "If I talk to people I don't know,", "start": 172.148, "end": 174.308}, {"index": 70, "text": "I don't feel very confident", "start": 173.908, "end": 177.189}, {"index": 71, "text": "unless I'm very well prepared.", "start": 176.829, "end": 178.75}, {"index": 72, "text": "I think,", "start": 178.35, "end": 179.85}, {"index": 73, "text": "being prepared is a good way to boost your confidence .", "start": 180.81, "end": 184.552}, {"index": 74, "text": "Yeah.", "start": 184.152, "end": 184.772}, {"index": 75, "text": "I remember watching a video,", "start": 184.372, "end": 187.112}, {"index": 76, "text": "about a lady saying,", "start": 187.733, "end": 189.673}, {"index": 77, "text": "if you want to improve your confidence , to boost your confidence ,", "start": 189.313, "end": 193.394}, {"index": 78, "text": "you should stand in a power stance", "start": 192.994, "end": 196.035}, {"index": 79, "text": "and think about all the good things that you're going to do,", "start": 196.276, "end": 200.537}, {"index": 80, "text": "and it will make you confident with your hands on your hips.", "start": 200.517, "end": 203.518}, {"index": 81, "text": "And she said, if you're going to do public speaking or something,", "start": 203.578, "end": 207.539}, {"index": 82, "text": "that's, really can be quite scary,", "start": 207.139, "end": 210.16}, {"index": 83, "text": "she said, even just go to the toilet,", "start": 210.26, "end": 212.601}, {"index": 84, "text": "stand in the toilet and do it on your own.", "start": 212.221, "end": 215.782}, {"index": 85, "text": "And apparently it increases your confidence .", "start": 215.682, "end": 218.843}, {"index": 86, "text": "Well, I must try that.", "start": 218.443, "end": 220.423}, {"index": 87, "text": "So, Neil, are there any situations", "start": 220.704, "end": 223.885}, {"index": 88, "text": "where you wish you were more confident ?", "start": 223.605, "end": 228.326}, {"index": 89, "text": "Maybe.", "start": 227.926, "end": 228.646}, {"index": 90, "text": "I mean,", "start": 228.246, "end": 230.627}, {"index": 91, "text": "I have a lot of experience of driving, and I'm quite confident driving.", "start": 230.227, "end": 234.288}, {"index": 92, "text": "But driving abroad, driving,", "start": 233.888, "end": 236.589}, {"index": 93, "text": "especially in a foreign city,", "start": 236.229, "end": 238.81}, {"index": 94, "text": "can be nerve-racking .", "start": 239.17, "end": 243.171}, {"index": 95, "text": "And yeah,", "start": 242.771, "end": 244.632}, {"index": 96, "text": "I think it would be nice to be more confident", "start": 244.232, "end": 247.372}, {"index": 97, "text": "driving abroad.", "start": 247.193, "end": 249.093}, {"index": 98, "text": "I was just thinking about language learning.", "start": 248.693, "end": 252.134}, {"index": 99, "text": "I wish I was more confident", "start": 251.734, "end": 255.195}, {"index": 100, "text": "when it came to speaking,", "start": 254.875, "end": 256.556}, {"index": 101, "text": "but I feel so shy and nervous.", "start": 256.156, "end": 258.796}, {"index": 102, "text": "If I'm, unless I'm in, say, like a language class, then I'll be OK.", "start": 258.436, "end": 262.818}, {"index": 103, "text": "But if I'm in the real world", "start": 262.598, "end": 264.898}, {"index": 104, "text": "and I have to speak to someone in Spanish, for example,", "start": 264.498, "end": 267.559}, {"index": 105, "text": "I get really nervous.", "start": 267.159, "end": 270.28}, {"index": 106, "text": "I have so much respect for people like", "start": 269.88, "end": 273.681}, {"index": 107, "text": "our audience", "start": 273.281, "end": 274.441}, {"index": 108, "text": "because they speak a foreign language,", "start": 274.041, "end": 277.142}, {"index": 109, "text": "and that's a really hard thing to do.", "start": 276.742, "end": 279.323}, {"index": 110, "text": "Nerve-racking .", "start": 279.103, "end": 280.323}, {"index": 111, "text": "You need confidence .", "start": 279.923, "end": 281.884}, {"index": 112, "text": "And, you know, well done to you.", "start": 281.484, "end": 284.405}, {"index": 113, "text": "Because, because it's not easy.", "start": 284.125, "end": 286.345}, {"index": 114, "text": "It's not easy at all.", "start": 285.985, "end": 287.486}, {"index": 115, "text": "We heard the word shy ,", "start": 294.228, "end": 296.689}, {"index": 116, "text": "which describes a person", "start": 296.289, "end": 298.709}, {"index": 117, "text": "who feels nervous", "start": 298.79, "end": 301.91}, {"index": 118, "text": "or uncomfortable", "start": 301.691, "end": 303.691}, {"index": 119, "text": "around other people.", "start": 303.291, "end": 305.172}, {"index": 120, "text": "If something is nerve-racking , it’s very stressful or worrying.", "start": 304.992, "end": 309.313}, {"index": 121, "text": "If something boosts your confidence ,", "start": 308.913, "end": 312.574}, {"index": 122, "text": "it makes you feel more confident.", "start": 312.174, "end": 314.975}, {"index": 123, "text": "And that's it for this episode of Real Easy", "start": 314.575, "end": 318.236}, {"index": 124, "text": "English.", "start": 317.836, "end": 319.116}, {"index": 125, "text": "Head over to our website for more episodes,", "start": 318.716, "end": 321.057}, {"index": 126, "text": "bbclearningenglish.com.", "start": 322.879, "end": 326.742}, {"index": 127, "text": "And next time", "start": 326.482, "end": 329.104}, {"index": 128, "text": "we'll be talking about our summer plans.", "start": 328.884, "end": 336.271}, {"index": 129, "text": "Join us then.", "start": 336.511, "end": 337.532}, {"index": 130, "text": "Bye.", "start": 337.552, "end": 338.353}]